[[2047,127,4194304,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Fix the alternator in a vice at the bench.</p><p>1. Keep the shaft still using a spanner (1a) and undo the pulley\nfixing nut using the spanner (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018752.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,4194304,"<p>1. Recover the washer (1a) and remove the pulley (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018753.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,4194304,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pulley and shaft are not\ndamaged.</p><p>1. Reposition the pulley in the housing.</p><p>2. Reposition the washer in the housing and tighten the nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018754.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,4194304,"<p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) fixing the pulley, using the special tool\n(1b) and the attachment (1c), USAG 233 1/2&quot; XZN.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.139.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018755.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,8388608,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Fix the alternator in a vice at the bench.</p><p>1. Use the special tool (1a) to keep the shaft still and undo the\npulley fixing nut (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.138.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018756.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,8388608,"<p>1. Recover the washer (1a) and remove the pulley (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018757.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,8388608,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pulley and shaft are not\ndamaged.</p><p>1. Reposition the pulley in the housing.</p><p>2. Reposition the washer in the housing and tighten the nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018758.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,8388608,"<p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) fixing the pulley, using the special tool\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.139.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018759.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]